<!--
  UPPMS — authorized users sample (schema 1.0)

  Matching on register (latest):
  - Student:    email + university_number  (both must match)
                Form field "student_number" = XML attribute "university_number"
  - Supervisor: email only
                Do NOT put university_number on <supervisor>

  How to test:
  1) Admin → Users → XML Import → upload this file
  2) Register a student with the SAME email + number from a <student> row
  3) Register a supervisor with the SAME email from a <supervisor> row
  4) Matched accounts become active immediately
-->
